{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CMJs5MWaBEwL1CDvNE4nU5","type":"tool_result","content":"author:\tuser\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\n## Preflight rulings (owner, 2026-10-01)\n\n1. Real detached supervisor; the status file is the only source of truth. The MCP `job_registry` stays untouched until #13.\n2. Record path: `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/<uuid>.json`.\n3. Record shape: whatever is cheapest to implement and parse. That means the existing `PollResult` JSON (camelCase) plus `supervisorPid`, `heartbeatAt` and `resume {model, cwd, capability, sessionId}`.\n4. Heartbeat: 30s by default. Tests shorten it with a `DELEGATE_HEARTBEAT_MS` environment override. The supervisor is a separate process, so a fake clock cannot be shared with it.\n5. `watch`: one JSON line per job, in argument order. Exit 0 when all are terminal. On timeout, print the current records and exit 1.\n6. `watch` on an unknown job id exits 2 at once.\n7. Bad input to `run` (unknown model, empty prompt) exits 2 with the reason on stderr. An unknown model also lists the valid ids.\n8. The CLI appends only the STATUS-line instruction. The MCP prompt path is unchanged.\n9. A status-record write failure makes the supervisor exit non-zero. A supervisor that dies leaving RUNNING is deferred to #9.\n10. A second `[[bin]]` named `delegate` in `src/bin/delegate.rs`, sharing the library.\n\n--\n[package]\nname = \"cursor-delegate-mcp\"\nversion = \"0.5.0\"\nedition = \"2024\"\nlicense = \"MIT\"\n\n[dependencies]\nserde = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }\nserde_json = { version = \"1\", features = [\"preserve_order\"] }\nlibc = \"0.2\"\nindexmap = { version = \"2\", features = [\"serde\"] }\n\n[profile.release]\nopt-level = \"s\"\nlto = true\ncodegen-units = 1\nstrip = true\ndocs/agents:\ndomain.md\nissue-tracker.md\ntriage-labels.md\n\nsrc:\nbackends\ncapability.rs\nconfig.rs\ncursor_bin.rs\ndoctor_tests.rs\ndoctor.rs\nfinalize.rs\ngate.rs\ngit.rs\nindex\nindex.rs\nisolation.rs\njob_registry\njob_registry.rs\nlib.rs\nmain.rs\nmodels.rs\noutput.rs\npricing.rs\nprogress.rs\nprompt.rs\nrunner\nrunner.rs\nsafety.rs\nstatus_record.rs\nstream.rs\ntool_schemas.rs\ntypes.rs\nutil.rs\nvalidate.rs\n\ntests:\ne2e.rs\nfixtures\nlive.rs\n     106 src/capability.rs\n     545 src/config.rs\n      48 src/cursor_bin.rs\n     768 src/doctor_tests.rs\n     612 src/doctor.rs\n     442 src/finalize.rs\n     271 src/gate.rs\n     261 src/git.rs\n     467 src/index.rs\n     118 src/isolation.rs\n     692 src/job_registry.rs\n      28 src/lib.rs\n       3 src/main.rs\n     178 src/models.rs\n     183 src/output.rs\n     119 src/pricing.rs\n     188 src/progress.rs\n     110 src/prompt.rs\n     221 src/runner.rs\n     101 src/safety.rs\n      55 src/status_record.rs\n     358 src/stream.rs\n     342 src/tool_schemas.rs\n     539 src/types.rs\n     165 src/util.rs\n     197 src/validate.rs\n    7117 total\n// Test seams are injected as `dyn Fn` fields, and the poll/dispatch results are short-lived\n// values returned once per call.\n#![allow(clippy::type_complexity, clippy::large_enum_variant)]\n\npub mod backends;\npub mod capability;\npub mod config;\npub mod cursor_bin;\npub mod doctor;\npub mod finalize;\npub mod gate;\npub mod git;\npub mod index;\npub mod isolation;\npub mod job_registry;\npub mod models;\npub mod output;\npub mod pricing;\npub mod progress;\npub mod prompt;\npub mod runner;\npub mod safety;\npub mod status_record;\npub mod stream;\npub mod tool_schemas;\npub mod types;\npub mod util;\npub mod validate;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a3efb08-3f9d-42fc-94c5-f574b1ccde60","uuid":"3199633a-6d68-4c71-9046-0a5f05382804","timestamp":"2026-10-01T08:43:31.057Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"author:\tuser\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\n## Preflight rulings (owner, 2026-10-01)\n\n1. Real detached supervisor; the status file is the only source of truth. The MCP `job_registry` stays untouched until #13.\n2. Record path: `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/<uuid>.json`.\n3. Record shape: whatever is cheapest to implement and parse. That means the existing `PollResult` JSON (camelCase) plus `supervisorPid`, `heartbeatAt` and `resume {model, cwd, capability, sessionId}`.\n4. Heartbeat: 30s by default. Tests shorten it with a `DELEGATE_HEARTBEAT_MS` environment override. The supervisor is a separate process, so a fake clock cannot be shared with it.\n5. `watch`: one JSON line per job, in argument order. Exit 0 when all are terminal. On timeout, print the current records and exit 1.\n6. `watch` on an unknown job id exits 2 at once.\n7. Bad input to `run` (unknown model, empty prompt) exits 2 with the reason on stderr. An unknown model also lists the valid ids.\n8. The CLI appends only the STATUS-line instruction. The MCP prompt path is unchanged.\n9. A status-record write failure makes the supervisor exit non-zero. A supervisor that dies leaving RUNNING is deferred to #9.\n10. A second `[[bin]]` named `delegate` in `src/bin/delegate.rs`, sharing the library.\n\n--\n[package]\nname = \"cursor-delegate-mcp\"\nversion = \"0.5.0\"\nedition = \"2024\"\nlicense = \"MIT\"\n\n[dependencies]\nserde = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }\nserde_json = { version = \"1\", features = [\"preserve_order\"] }\nlibc = \"0.2\"\nindexmap = { version = \"2\", features = [\"serde\"] }\n\n[profile.release]\nopt-level = \"s\"\nlto = true\ncodegen-units = 1\nstrip = true\ndocs/agents:\ndomain.md\nissue-tracker.md\ntriage-labels.md\n\nsrc:\nbackends\ncapability.rs\nconfig.rs\ncursor_bin.rs\ndoctor_tests.rs\ndoctor.rs\nfinalize.rs\ngate.rs\ngit.rs\nindex\nindex.rs\nisolation.rs\njob_registry\njob_registry.rs\nlib.rs\nmain.rs\nmodels.rs\noutput.rs\npricing.rs\nprogress.rs\nprompt.rs\nrunner\nrunner.rs\nsafety.rs\nstatus_record.rs\nstream.rs\ntool_schemas.rs\ntypes.rs\nutil.rs\nvalidate.rs\n\ntests:\ne2e.rs\nfixtures\nlive.rs\n     106 src/capability.rs\n     545 src/config.rs\n      48 src/cursor_bin.rs\n     768 src/doctor_tests.rs\n     612 src/doctor.rs\n     442 src/finalize.rs\n     271 src/gate.rs\n     261 src/git.rs\n     467 src/index.rs\n     118 src/isolation.rs\n     692 src/job_registry.rs\n      28 src/lib.rs\n       3 src/main.rs\n     178 src/models.rs\n     183 src/output.rs\n     119 src/pricing.rs\n     188 src/progress.rs\n     110 src/prompt.rs\n     221 src/runner.rs\n     101 src/safety.rs\n      55 src/status_record.rs\n     358 src/stream.rs\n     342 src/tool_schemas.rs\n     539 src/types.rs\n     165 src/util.rs\n     197 src/validate.rs\n    7117 total\n// Test seams are injected as `dyn Fn` fields, and the poll/dispatch results are short-lived\n// values returned once per call.\n#![allow(clippy::type_complexity, clippy::large_enum_variant)]\n\npub mod backends;\npub mod capability;\npub mod config;\npub mod cursor_bin;\npub mod doctor;\npub mod finalize;\npub mod gate;\npub mod git;\npub mod index;\npub mod isolation;\npub mod job_registry;\npub mod models;\npub mod output;\npub mod pricing;\npub mod progress;\npub mod prompt;\npub mod runner;\npub mod safety;\npub mod status_record;\npub mod stream;\npub mod tool_schemas;\npub mod types;\npub mod util;\npub mod validate;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
